{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09100","headline":"登郡寄京师诸季淮南子弟 · 韦应物","name":"登郡寄京师诸季淮南子弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"始罢永阳守，复卧浔阳楼。\n悬槛飘寒雨，危堞侵江流。\n迨兹闻雁夜，重忆别离秋。\n徒有盈樽酒，镇此百端忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}